{"4304240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Not Our Crime", "steam_appid": 4304240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Henchmen</strong> is a chaotic reverse-detective co-op game where you and your friends play as incompetent henchmen sent to clean up crimes that are way above your pay grade. Hide evidence, sabotage the scene, panic, improvise, and somehow make it look like nothing ever happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕴️ Online P2P co-op multiplayer (up to 4 players)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🖐️ Two-hand system. Each hand can carry items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧹 Clean and manipulate evidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕵️ Active detective system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚓 Police presence that escalates the situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧍 Hiding spots to avoid detection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛠️ Interactive tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧃 Consumable items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🖕 Funny gestures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧹 Cleaning system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💬 Proximity voice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 Performance-based scoring system.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Henchmen</strong> is a chaotic reverse-detective co-op game where you and your friends play as incompetent henchmen sent to clean up crimes that are way above your pay grade. Hide evidence, sabotage the scene, panic, improvise, and somehow make it look like nothing ever happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕴️ Online P2P co-op multiplayer (up to 4 players)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🖐️ Two-hand system. Each hand can carry items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧹 Clean and manipulate evidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕵️ Active detective system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚓 Police prese